PS5LM: add get_datetime, web_search and web_fetch to llama-server's tools, and make get_info work without spawning a process.

A title cannot start Python, curl or an MCP server. The search runs in the app through libSceHttp2 (ps5lm_web_search, ps5lm_web_fetch). The clock is read here. get_info used to run uname, which a title cannot do.

